# cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only batch files (lines get swallowed, so e.g.
# "cd gui" in start_gui.bat is lost and electron starts in the repo root:
# "Unable to find Electron app at ..."). Force CRLF for all .bat files.
# NOTE: start_gui.bat also avoids multi-line "if (...) (...)" blocks: cmd
# mis-parses them (quotes inside the block get dropped and a stray "-" is
# reported as: "- was unexpected at this time."). Use "goto :label" instead.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
